                                                "sense_id": "b9535cf6-c592-39d5-b010-9d30c7a187d1",
                                                "text": "In business, due to the stigma of alcoholism, enablers have their jobs and incomes at stake if their boss's secret is uncovered."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
